{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 201,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.3892211914062,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "and VST may replace in-person treatment support for certain periods of time rather than for the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        477.0916442871094,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "entire duration of treatment and that they promote patient-centered approaches to care.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        102.29462432861328,
        527.1814575195312,
        116.73762512207031
      ],
      "text": "Mobile telephone interventions, tracers and VST may also increase health equity if the need to travel to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.955108642578125,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.49463653564453,
        527.31884765625,
        129.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "a health clinic or to a patient’s home is reduced. However, the ability of patients to participate in these",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.987442970275879,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.69459533691406,
        524.58837890625,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "programmes depends on the patient living in an area with a good telecommunications infrastructure.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98478889465332,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.5385284423828,
        228.09375,
        175.19851684570312
      ],
      "text": "Material support for patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.1304473876953,
        527.4194946289062,
        196.8494415283203
      ],
      "text": "(69–72) The effects of material support were examined both with randomized controlled trials  and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.3303985595703,
        527.4068603515625,
        210.0493927001953
      ],
      "text": "(78, 111–118) observational studies  . The interventions included giving meals with treatment support",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        208.80641174316406,
        527.5835571289062,
        223.24940490722656
      ],
      "text": "with observation, monthly food vouchers, food baskets, food supplements and vitamins. Food support",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.957366943359375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        222.0063018798828,
        527.4619750976562,
        236.4492950439453
      ],
      "text": "for patients and family members is an important incentive for TB patients and also helps protect",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        235.20643615722656,
        527.3739624023438,
        249.64942932128906
      ],
      "text": "patients from the catastrophic costs associated with TB. Food may be an incentive but it may also",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        248.4064483642578,
        527.2596435546875,
        262.8494567871094
      ],
      "text": "improve the outcome biologically by reducing malnutrition and consequently improving immune",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        261.60638427734375,
        527.13134765625,
        276.0494079589844
      ],
      "text": "function. Other material support could be in the form of financial incentives, transport subsidies, living",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.975071907043457,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        274.806396484375,
        457.0200500488281,
        289.2494201660156
      ],
      "text": "allowance, housing incentives, or financial bonuses after reaching treatment targets.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        296.51031494140625,
        527.399169921875,
        310.9533386230469
      ],
      "text": "There were higher rates of treatment success, completion and sputum conversion in patients who",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        309.7103271484375,
        527.4356079101562,
        324.1533508300781
      ],
      "text": "received material support, and lower rates of treatment failure and loss to follow-up compared with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        322.9103088378906,
        527.4365234375,
        337.35333251953125
      ],
      "text": "patients who did not receive material support. It is of note that all these studies were in low- and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        336.1103210449219,
        527.4278564453125,
        350.5533447265625
      ],
      "text": "middle-income countries, so presumably these incentives were of significant value to the patients in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        349.310302734375,
        527.437744140625,
        363.7533264160156
      ],
      "text": "these settings. However, the material support would also be of significant value to TB patients even",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        362.51031494140625,
        527.4309692382812,
        376.9533386230469
      ],
      "text": "in higher-income countries, especially in countries that do not have a good social welfare system,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        375.7102966308594,
        214.41172790527344,
        390.1533203125
      ],
      "text": "since TB is a disease of poverty.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        397.4142150878906,
        527.453369140625,
        411.85723876953125
      ],
      "text": "The studies in this review found that material support was usually given to the most vulnerable groups,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999699592590332,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        410.61431884765625,
        527.45947265625,
        425.0573425292969
      ],
      "text": "and therefore health equity was presumably improved by this intervention. However, if these incentives",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993147850036621,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.814208984375,
        527.423828125,
        438.2572326660156
      ],
      "text": "are not applied equitably, health disparities may be increased. The distribution of material support is likely",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.95300006866455,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.0141906738281,
        524.4310913085938,
        451.45721435546875
      ],
      "text": "to depend on the country context and may have different effects both within and between countries.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        467.85809326171875,
        313.39453125,
        483.5180969238281
      ],
      "text": "Patient education or educational counselling",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        489.45001220703125,
        527.43017578125,
        505.1690368652344
      ],
      "text": "(64–67) Analysis of the benefit of patient education included randomized controlled trials  and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        502.650146484375,
        527.4024658203125,
        518.369140625
      ],
      "text": "(75) observational studies  . Patients who received education or educational counselling had better",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        517.1260986328125,
        527.4993896484375,
        531.569091796875
      ],
      "text": "rates of treatment success, treatment completion, cure and treatment adherence, and had lower rates",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977375984191895,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        530.3260498046875,
        527.36474609375,
        544.76904296875
      ],
      "text": "of loss to follow-up. It should be noted in this case that “counselling” refers to educational counselling",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.986991882324219,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        543.526123046875,
        527.2825927734375,
        557.9691162109375
      ],
      "text": "and not psychological counselling. Patient education could include oral or written education via",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        556.7260131835938,
        527.5556030273438,
        571.1690063476562
      ],
      "text": "health-care workers or pharmacists. The education could be a one-time session at discharge from the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977076530456543,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        569.9261474609375,
        527.4179077148438,
        584.369140625
      ],
      "text": "intensive phase of therapy or at each presentation for follow-up care. The educational session might",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        583.1259765625,
        527.4410400390625,
        597.5689697265625
      ],
      "text": "include only the health-care worker and patient, or it could involve the patients’ social network and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        596.3259887695312,
        527.442138671875,
        610.7689819335938
      ],
      "text": "family members. It is important to make sure that education and counselling are done in a culturally",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        609.526123046875,
        527.4124145507812,
        623.9691162109375
      ],
      "text": "appropriate manner. Additionally, specific marginalized populations may require special educational",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        622.72607421875,
        102.75179290771484,
        637.1690673828125
      ],
      "text": "efforts.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        653.5698852539062,
        153.36131286621094,
        669.2299194335938
      ],
      "text": "Staff education",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        676.4379272460938,
        527.586669921875,
        690.8809204101562
      ],
      "text": "Staff education may include peer training, visual aids to help initiate conversations with patients, other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977176666259766,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.637939453125,
        527.367431640625,
        704.0809326171875
      ],
      "text": "tools to aid in decision-making and as reminders, as well as the education of laboratory staff. This",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        701.5618896484375,
        527.4507446289062,
        717.2808837890625
      ],
      "text": "(68, 69, 118) intervention was examined in both randomized controlled trials  and observational studies",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.97081184387207,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        714.7617797851562,
        527.5794067382812,
        730.4807739257812
      ],
      "text": "(119) . Staff education led to higher rates of treatment success and slightly lower rates of mortality and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.990845680236816,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        729.23779296875,
        527.4464111328125,
        743.6807861328125
      ],
      "text": "loss to follow-up. With better staff education, treatment for patients is likely to improve. Any stigma",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        742.4379272460938,
        527.54150390625,
        756.8809204101562
      ],
      "text": "that health-care workers may hold towards patients would decrease as the health-care workers better",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977025985717773,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        755.637939453125,
        259.4963073730469,
        770.0809326171875
      ],
      "text": "understand TB disease and TB treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        323.2414855957031,
        801.0170288085938,
        556.099609375,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 3 Tuberculosis care and support: Recommendations 187",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}